OL,3,GNEWSA'Whale snot' drones used to
OL,4,Acollect DNA from blowhole spout
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish researchers have collected DNA
OL,7,Fprofiles of humpback whales by flying a
OL,8,Fdrone through "snot" exhaled from their
OL,9,Fblowholes.
OL,11,FScientists from the University of St
OL,12,FAndrews said they had sequenced a whole
OL,13,Fwhale genome from breath collected by
OL,14,Fsterile petri dishes attached to
OL,15,Funmanned aircraft which hovered in the
OL,16,F"blow" emitted by the animals off the
OL,17,Fwestern Canadian coast.
OL,19,FIt is hoped the technique could be used
OL,20,Ffor future sampling and avoid the need
OL,21,Ffor close boat approaches.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
