OL,3,GNEWSA'Whale snot' drones used to
OL,4,Acollect DNA from blowhole spout
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Eadin O'Mahony, of the Scottish
OL,7,FOceans Institute, said the data
OL,8,Fcollected would help researchers
OL,9,Funderstand whale behaviour.
